  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO INCLUSIVE &amp; EFFECTIVE NATIONAL DEALOGUE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support to an Inclusive and Effective National Dialogue Process in Ethiopia, implemented by UNDP, aims to contribute towards laying-down the critical foundations and institutions for effective, peaceful and constructive dialogue in Ethiopia. Main activities include conduct targeted research and assessments including a capacity assessment, develop strategy plan and road map, recruitment of international and national experts, provision of trainings as well as IT equipment, facilitation of consultations, provide technical and logistical support in dialogue agenda selection and participants&#x2019; identification as well as engaging with groups of youth, women and media. The main target of the project is Ethiopian National Dialogue Commission, ENDC.</narrative>
  </description>
